1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
🎵 나 같은 죄인 살리신 (찬송가 305장)
Amazing Grace (Hymn 305) - Arise Next Gen

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:25,000
[1절] 나 같은 죄인 살리신 주 은혜 놀라워
Amazing grace! how sweet the sound That saved a wretch like me!

3
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:45,000
잃었던 생명 찾았고 광명을 얻었네
I once was lost, but now am found, Was blind, but now I see.

4
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:05,000
[2절] 큰 죄악에서 건지신 주 은혜 고마워
'Twas grace that taught my heart to fear, And grace my fears relieved;

5
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:25,000
나 처음 믿은 그 시간 귀하고 귀하다
How precious did that grace appear The hour I first believed!

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:45,000
[3절] 이제껏 내가 산 것도 주님의 은혜라
Through many dangers, toils and snares, I have already come;

7
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:05,000
또 나를 장차 본향에 인도해 주시리
'Tis grace hath brought me safe thus far, And grace will lead me home.

8
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:25,000
[4절] 거기서 우리 영원히 주님의 은혜로
When we've been there ten thousand years, Bright shining as the sun,

9
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:45,000
해처럼 밝게 살면서 주 찬양 하리라
We've no less days to sing God's praise Than when we'd first begun.

10
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:50,000
🕊️ 주님의 은혜에 감사드립니다 · 아멘
Giving Thanks to God's Abundant Grace · Amen

